IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `slaa-authority`

-- Singapore Land Authority Act 2001, ss 2, 5, 8, 12, 20, 21, 30-33, 35, First and Third Schedules -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_singapore-land-authority-act-2001.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

